Modifications: level-design and the generation half of procedural-gen were
merged into one skill with two references (pacing-encounters.md, procgen.md)
and rewritten in the house style. Engine API and Python and GDScript code were
replaced with engine-neutral pseudocode and pointers to the engine skills. The
weighted loot-table material was left out (it belongs to game-design). From
GodotPrompter, the cellular-automata cave parameters and the wave function
collapse algorithm were taken; the WFC loop was corrected to detect
contradictions during propagation (the upstream sample skipped cells with
zero options and could report success with holes). Added: sub-seeds,
stable string hashing and other determinism rules, MST corridors with loops,
encounter and arena design, and a validation pass for generated levels.

